{"about_the_game":"\u25b6 Please choose 24 heroes and enjoy the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915460/extras/79edc2002277c5a0b540d388e2538e4b.avif?t=1653665512\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br>\u25b6 This game is a low-spec 2d MMORPG, and there is a MOBA system in which the four forces of Wei(\u9b4f), Shu(\u8700), Wu(\u5433), and Han(\u6f22) fight in the game every hour. (All players can start with the same condition at the same level.)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915460/extras/52fb62283ee29e3c459454a18b589c68.poster.avif?t=1653665512\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915460/extras/52fb62283ee29e3c459454a18b589c68.webm?t=1653665512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915460/extras/52fb62283ee29e3c459454a18b589c68.mp4?t=1653665512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25b6 Divide into three factions and participate in the Red Cliff War. You can get BUFF, which increases the attack speed of your character.<br><br>\u25b6 Join the forces of Cao Cao and Yuan shao and participate in the Guandu Wars.<br>You can earn war-points.<br><br>\u25b6 You can make a \u300csworn brother\u300d. When you have an emergency, you can immediately call in your \u300csworn brother\u300d. Escape the crisis with him.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915460/extras/e1dea4071dcc3dde41113931ca301662.avif?t=1653665512\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br>\u25b6 Depending on the weather, each area will be changed to a PK area, but a greater reward awaits you.<br><br>Depending on the wind direction, each faction can acquire additional BUFF.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915460/extras/f28697d58e4a326cf00becc0981f157b.avif?t=1653665512\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><br>\u25b6 Participate in the Siege of Chang'An. You can earn 6 million RTK points.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915460/extras/aaf864995ffd8b000b237a286f8c9ca5.avif?t=1653665512\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><br>\u25b6 Participate in rivalry of local barons. You can fight for a total prize money of 3 million RTK points.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1915460?t=1653665512","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1653665512","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1653665512","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915460/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1653665512","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Special Edition</h1><p>It offers 1000 vs. 1000 battles for $4.99 and there are no additional purchases to buy.<br><strong>It's not pay-to-win.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915460/extras/31ccd6a4cb40e764999c9c5927274247.poster.avif?t=1653665512\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915460/ex